{
 "version": 1,
 "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-3",
 "asignatura": "matematicas",
 "anio": 2005,
 "convocatoria": "Reserva 3",
 "documento": "MAT-2005-RESERVA_3.pdf",
 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-3-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Se sabe que \\[\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x-\\alpha\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}{x^2}\\] es finito. Determina el valor de \\(\\alpha\\) y calcula el límite.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Para cualquier \\(\\alpha\\) es \\(\\frac00\\). Aplico la regla de L'Hôpital<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>:</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x-\\alpha\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}{x^2}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{1-\\alpha\\cos x}{2x}=\\frac{1-\\alpha}0\\]<p>Si \\(\\alpha\\neq1\\) sería infinito<i class='n' data-t='why'>Un número distinto de cero dividido entre algo que tiende a 0 da infinito: el límite no sería finito.</i>. Por tanto \\(\\alpha=1\\), y queda \\(\\frac00\\):</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{1-\\cos x}{2x}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}2=0\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\alpha=1\\) y el límite vale \\(0\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "lim",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2005-RESERVA_3.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-3-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}2x+4&\\text{si }x\\leq0\\\\(x-2)^2&\\text{si }x\\gt0\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Calcula los puntos de corte de la gráfica de \\(f\\) con el eje de abscisas y esboza dicha gráfica.",
     "(1,5 p.) Halla el área de la región acotada que está limitada por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y por el eje de abscisas."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Para \\(x\\leq0\\): \\(2x+4=0\\iff x=-2\\). Para \\(x\\gt0\\): \\((x-2)^2=0\\iff x=2\\) (vértice de la parábola). Los dos trozos valen 4 en \\(x=0\\): \\(f\\) es continua.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='59.4,153.3 61.4,150.7 63.3,148.0 65.3,145.3 67.3,142.7 69.2,140.0 71.2,137.3 73.2,134.7 75.2,132.0 77.1,129.3 79.1,126.7 81.1,124.0 83.0,121.3 85.0,118.7 87.0,116.0 88.9,113.3 90.9,110.7 92.9,108.0 94.8,105.3 96.8,102.7 98.8,100.0 100.8,97.3 102.7,94.7 104.7,92.0 106.7,89.3 108.6,86.7 110.6,84.0 112.6,81.3 114.5,78.7 116.5,76.0 118.5,73.3 120.5,70.7 122.4,68.0 124.4,65.3 126.4,62.7 128.3,60.0 130.3,57.3 132.3,54.7 134.2,52.0 136.2,49.3 138.2,46.7 140.2,51.9 142.1,57.1 144.1,62.1 146.1,66.9 148.0,71.7 150.0,76.3 152.0,80.7 153.9,85.1 155.9,89.3 157.9,93.3 159.8,97.3 161.8,101.1 163.8,104.7 165.8,108.3 167.7,111.7 169.7,114.9 171.7,118.1 173.6,121.1 175.6,123.9 177.6,126.7 179.5,129.3 181.5,131.7 183.5,134.1 185.5,136.3 187.4,138.3 189.4,140.3 191.4,142.1 193.3,143.7 195.3,145.3 197.3,146.7 199.2,147.9 201.2,149.1 203.2,150.1 205.2,150.9 207.1,151.7 209.1,152.3 211.1,152.7 213.0,153.1 215.0,153.3 217.0,153.3 217.0,153.3 215.0,153.3 213.0,153.3 211.1,153.3 209.1,153.3 207.1,153.3 205.2,153.3 203.2,153.3 201.2,153.3 199.2,153.3 197.3,153.3 195.3,153.3 193.3,153.3 191.4,153.3 189.4,153.3 187.4,153.3 185.5,153.3 183.5,153.3 181.5,153.3 179.5,153.3 177.6,153.3 175.6,153.3 173.6,153.3 171.7,153.3 169.7,153.3 167.7,153.3 165.8,153.3 163.8,153.3 161.8,153.3 159.8,153.3 157.9,153.3 155.9,153.3 153.9,153.3 152.0,153.3 150.0,153.3 148.0,153.3 146.1,153.3 144.1,153.3 142.1,153.3 140.2,153.3 138.2,153.3 136.2,153.3 134.2,153.3 132.3,153.3 130.3,153.3 128.3,153.3 126.4,153.3 124.4,153.3 122.4,153.3 120.5,153.3 118.5,153.3 116.5,153.3 114.5,153.3 112.6,153.3 110.6,153.3 108.6,153.3 106.7,153.3 104.7,153.3 102.7,153.3 100.8,153.3 98.8,153.3 96.8,153.3 94.8,153.3 92.9,153.3 90.9,153.3 88.9,153.3 87.0,153.3 85.0,153.3 83.0,153.3 81.1,153.3 79.1,153.3 77.1,153.3 75.2,153.3 73.2,153.3 71.2,153.3 69.2,153.3 67.3,153.3 65.3,153.3 63.3,153.3 61.4,153.3 59.4,153.3' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='27.9,196.0 83.0,121.3 138.2,46.7' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='138.2,46.7 140.4,52.6 142.6,58.4 144.9,64.0 147.1,69.5 149.3,74.7 151.6,79.9 153.8,84.8 156.0,89.5 158.3,94.1 160.5,98.5 162.7,102.8 165.0,106.9 167.2,110.8 169.4,114.5 171.7,118.1 173.9,121.5 176.1,124.7 178.4,127.7 180.6,130.6 182.8,133.3 185.1,135.8 187.3,138.2 189.5,140.4 191.8,142.4 194.0,144.3 196.2,145.9 198.5,147.4 200.7,148.8 202.9,149.9 205.2,150.9 207.4,151.8 209.6,152.4 211.8,152.9 214.1,153.2 216.3,153.3 218.5,153.3 220.8,153.1 223.0,152.7 225.2,152.2 227.5,151.4 229.7,150.5 231.9,149.5 234.2,148.2 236.4,146.8 238.6,145.3 240.9,143.5 243.1,141.6 245.3,139.5 247.6,137.2 249.8,134.8 252.0,132.2 254.3,129.4 256.5,126.5 258.7,123.4 261.0,120.1 263.2,116.6 265.4,113.0 267.7,109.2 269.9,105.2 272.1,101.1' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='59.4' cy='153.3' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='39.4' y='169.3'>(−2,0)</text><circle cx='217.0' cy='153.3' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='209.0' y='169.3'>(2,0)</text><circle cx='138.2' cy='46.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='144.2' y='42.7'>(0,4)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 153.3H294.0M138.2 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='98.8' y1='150.3' x2='98.8' y2='156.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='95.8' y='167.3' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='177.6' y1='150.3' x2='177.6' y2='156.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='174.6' y='167.3' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='256.4' y1='150.3' x2='256.4' y2='156.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='253.4' y='167.3' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='135.2' y1='100.0' x2='141.2' y2='100.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='122.2' y='104.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='135.2' y1='46.7' x2='141.2' y2='46.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='122.2' y='50.7' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Corta al eje de abscisas en \\((-2,0)\\) y \\((2,0)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre \\(-2\\) y \\(2\\), \\(f\\geq0\\):</p>\\[A=\\int_{-2}^0(2x+4)\\,dx+\\int_0^2(x-2)^2\\,dx=\\Bigl[x^2+4x\\Bigr]_{-2}^0+\\Bigl[\\frac{(x-2)^3}3\\Bigr]_0^2=4+\\frac83=\\frac{20}3\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{20}3\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "rep",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2005-RESERVA_3.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-3-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el sistema de ecuaciones \\[\\begin{cases}(b+1)x+y+z=2\\\\x+(b+1)y+z=2\\\\x+y+(b+1)z=-4\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Clasifica el sistema según los valores del parámetro \\(b\\).",
     "(1 p.) Resuelve el sistema cuando sea compatible indeterminado."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}b+1&1&1&2\\\\1&b+1&1&2\\\\1&1&b+1&-4\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}b+1&1&1\\\\1&b+1&1\\\\1&1&b+1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(b^{3} + 3 b^{2} + 3 b + 1+1+1\\bigr)-\\bigl(b + 1+b + 1+b + 1\\bigr)\\]\\[=b^3+3b^2=b^2(b+3)\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(b\\neq0,-3\\)<b>:</b> compatible determinado.</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(b=0\\)<b>:</b> las tres ecuaciones son \\(x+y+z=2\\), \\(x+y+z=2\\), \\(x+y+z=-4\\): <b>incompatible</b>.</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(b=-3\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}-2&1\\\\1&-2\\end{vmatrix}=3\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}-2&1&2\\\\1&-2&2\\\\1&1&-4\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-16+2+2\\bigr)-\\bigl(-4-4-4\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\): <b>compatible indeterminado</b>.</p><div class='res'>Si \\(b\\neq0,-3\\): compatible determinado. Si \\(b=-3\\): compatible indeterminado. Si \\(b=0\\): incompatible</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(b=-3\\): \\(-2x+y+z=2\\), \\(x-2y+z=2\\). Restando: \\(-3x+3y=0\\iff y=x\\). En la 1.ª, \\(-x+z=2\\). Con \\(z=t\\): \\(x=y=t-2\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x=t-2,\\ y=t-2,\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación en la 3.ª: \\(t-2+t-2-2t=-4\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "disc",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "res",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2005-RESERVA_3.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-3-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Se sabe que las rectas \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x+y-z-3=0\\\\x+2y-2=0\\end{cases}\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\begin{cases}ax+6y+6=0\\\\x-2z+2=0\\end{cases}\\) son paralelas.",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula \\(a\\).",
     "(1 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano que contiene a las rectas \\(r\\) y \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Directores (producto vectorial de las normales de cada par de planos):</p>\\[\\vec d_r=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&1&-1\\\\1&2&0\\end{vmatrix}=(2,\\,-1,\\,1),\\qquad\\vec d_s=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\a&6&0\\\\1&0&-2\\end{vmatrix}=(-12,\\,2a,\\,-6)\\]<p>Paralelas: \\(\\vec d_s\\) proporcional a \\(\\vec d_r\\). Con las componentes 1.ª y 3.ª, \\(\\vec d_s=-6\\vec d_r\\); la 2.ª obliga a \\(2a=6\\iff a=3\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=3\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
